OL,3,GNEWSABlood scandal campaigner's fight
OL,4,Afor justice for dad
OL,5,
OL,6,FJason Evans spent a decade campaigning
OL,7,Ffor the victims of the infected blood
OL,8,Fscandal in memory of his father who
OL,9,Fdied when he was just four years old.
OL,11,FBut he has revealed how he discovered
OL,12,Fquite by chance that, dad Jonathan
OL,13,FEvans, the man he had been campaigning
OL,14,Ffor, was not his biological father.
OL,16,FHe said finding out that the pair were
OL,17,Fnot related "altered my understanding
OL,18,Fof where I came from biologically, but
OL,19,Fit could not undo fatherhood, love,
OL,20,Fmemory or grief. Those things had been
OL,21,Freal all along".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
